== Notes ==
* This coin grants the player five ''extra'' lives. In addition, each continue brings the player back to life. It is therefore more efficient to use one coin at a time, effectively producing six lives per coin, than to redeem multiple coins for one continue.

== Trivia ==
* The Continue Coin is a reference to [[w:Token coin|tokens]] which were often used as substitutes for legal tender at video arcades.

